      ],
      "impact": "The keyboard columns are not on GPIO pins, so the keyboard will not scan correctly. The Ethernet PHY pins are loaded by the keyboard, and the MIC output is shorted to an Ethernet PHY pin, likely causing malfunction or damage.",
      "confidence": 0.95
